{
    "chapter_num": 23,
    "verses_count": 32,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Divisions of the Levites"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when David was old and full of days, he made his son Solomon king over Israel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he gathered together all the leaders of Israel, with the priests and the Levites. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the Levites were numbered from the age of thirty years and above; and the number of individual males was thirty-eight thousand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of these, twenty-four thousand "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to look after the work of the house of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", six thousand "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " officers and judges, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "four thousand "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " gatekeepers, and four thousand praised the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "musical"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " instruments, “which I made,” "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "said David,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " “for giving praise.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also David separated them into "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "groups"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "divisions among the sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the Gershonites: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Libni, Ex. 6:17"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Laadan and Shimei. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Laadan: the first Jehiel, then Zetham and Joel—three "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in all."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Shimei: Shelomith, Haziel, and Haran—three "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in all."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " These were the heads of the fathers’ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "houses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Laadan. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the sons of Shimei: Jahath, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "LXX, Vg. Zizah and v. 11"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zina, Jeush, and Beriah. These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the four sons of Shimei. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jahath was the first and Zizah the second. But Jeush and Beriah did not have many sons; therefore they were assigned as one father’s house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Kohath: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel—four "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in all."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Amram: Aaron and Moses; and Aaron was set apart, he and his sons forever, that he should "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "consecrate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctify the most holy things, to burn incense before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", to minister to Him, and to give the blessing in His name forever. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the sons of Moses the man of God were reckoned to the tribe of Levi. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Moses "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Gershom, 1 Chr. 6:16"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Gershon and Eliezer. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the sons of Gershon, Shebuel"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Shubael, 1 Chr. 24:20"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the first. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the descendants of Eliezer, Rehabiah was the first. And Eliezer had no other sons, but the sons of Rehabiah were very many. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the sons of Izhar, Shelomith "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the first. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the sons of Hebron, Jeriah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the first, Amariah the second, Jahaziel the third, and Jekameam the fourth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the sons of Uzziel, Michah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the first and Jesshiah the second."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Merari "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Mahli and Mushi. The sons of Mahli "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Eleazar and Kish. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Eleazar died, and had no sons, but only daughters; and their "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "kinsmen"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "brethren, the sons of Kish, took them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as wives."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Mushi "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Mahli, Eder, and Jeremoth—three "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in all."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of Levi by their fathers’ houses—the heads of the fathers’ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "houses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as they were counted individually by the number of their names, who did the work for the service of the house of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", from the age of twenty years and above."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For David said, “The "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of Israel has given rest to His people, that they may dwell in Jerusalem forever”; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and also to the Levites, “They shall no longer carry the tabernacle, or any of the articles for its service.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For by the last words of David the Levites "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " numbered from twenty years old and above; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "because their duty "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to help the sons of Aaron in the service of the house of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", in the courts and in the chambers, in the purifying of all holy things and the work of the service of the house of God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "both with the showbread and the fine flour for the grain offering, with the unleavened cakes and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "what is baked in"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the pan, with what is mixed and with all kinds of measures and sizes; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to stand every morning to thank and praise the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and likewise at evening; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and at every presentation of a burnt offering to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the Sabbaths and on the New Moons and on the set"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "appointed feasts"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " feasts, by number according to the ordinance governing them, regularly before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and that they should attend to the needs of the tabernacle of meeting, the needs of the holy "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "place,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and the needs of the sons of Aaron their brethren in the work of the house of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}